{"id":"c0cd9cf0111388d9","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Imperfect Information Partition","display":"df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition — ZFC Game4 Imperfect Information Partition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition — ZFC Game4 Imperfect Information Partition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition — ZFC Game4 Imperfect Information Partition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4338267410bc733e\" href=\"?note=4338267410bc733e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md\">58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,P,A,i,\\mathcal I \\in V\">\\(H,P,A,i,\\mathcal I \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_i(H,P)\">\\(H_i(H,P)\\)</span> is the decision-history set defined below and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Term}(H)\">\\(\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4338267410bc733e\" href=\"?note=4338267410bc733e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md\">58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ImperfectInformationPartition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ImperfectInformationPartition}_S\\)</span> is the five-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}player\\text{-}histories} \\vdash H_i(H,P)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H):P(h)=i\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}player\\text{-}histories} \\vdash H_i(H,P)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H):P(h)=i\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}imperfect\\text{-}information\\text{-}partition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4ImperfectInformationPartition}_S(H,P,A,i,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(H_i(H,P))\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal I=H_i(H,P)\\land\\forall I,J\\in\\mathcal I\\;(I\\neq J\\to I\\cap J=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall h,h&#39;\\in I\\;(A(h)=A(h&#39;))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}imperfect\\text{-}information\\text{-}partition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4ImperfectInformationPartition}_S(H,P,A,i,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(H_i(H,P))\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal I=H_i(H,P)\\land\\forall I,J\\in\\mathcal I\\;(I\\neq J\\to I\\cap J=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall h,h&#39;\\in I\\;(A(h)=A(h&#39;))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Information sets partition the decision histories of player <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>, and the available actions are constant on each information set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md","status":"resolved","id":"4338267410bc733e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md","status":"resolved","id":"4338267410bc733e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H_i(H,P)$ is the decision-history set defined below and $\\operatorname{Term}(H)$ is from [[58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,P,A,i,\\mathcal I \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"H_i(H,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Term}(H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ImperfectInformationPartition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}player\\text{-}histories} \\vdash H_i(H,P)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H):P(h)=i\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}imperfect\\text{-}information\\text{-}partition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4ImperfectInformationPartition}_S(H,P,A,i,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(H_i(H,P))\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal I=H_i(H,P)\\land\\forall I,J\\in\\mathcal I\\;(I\\neq J\\to I\\cap J=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall h,h'\\in I\\;(A(h)=A(h'))","display":true},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":1434,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2200","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition.md|58-df-zfc-game4-imperfect-information-partition]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","4338267410bc733e"]}